new file mode 100644
index 0000000..beeaa64
--- /dev/null
+++ b/regamedll/dlls/pokemon.h
@@ -0,0 +1,346 @@
+/*
+*	Half Strike: Poke Balls. Three grenade-slot items (weapon_pk_pikachu, weapon_pk_charizard, weapon_pk_blastoise),
+*	thrown like the Half-Life hand grenade; the ball opens and its Pokemon (monster_pokemon) comes out, follows its
+*	player, and charges the enemy its player shoots at or that hurts its player or itself, with its own attack.
+*
+*	Their ids follow the Half-Life arsenal's (weapontype.h): IsHLWeapon covers them too, so they reach the client by the
+*	HLWeapons message, are not predicted, and bots neither buy nor pick them up.
+*
+*	The client draws the health bars from the PokeHP message: short entity index (two bytes, low first), byte health
+*	percent (0: gone), byte species (0 Pikachu, 1 Charizard, 2 Blastoise), byte team (1 T, 2 CT, 0 none), byte owner
+*	player index. Sent to all on spawn, at each change of the percent and at death or removal, and to each client at its
+*	HUD reset (all Pokemon out).
+*
+*	The models, sprites and sounds are Half Strike's own (the asset generator), under models/pokemon, sprites/pokemon
+*	and sound/pokemon.
+*
+*	Le M (species 3, models/others, sprites/others, sound/others) is a companion of the same kind, summoned with a
+*	laptop (weapon_lem_laptop, id 49, after the balls): fired, its player types for a while, then Le M materialises
+*	where it aims, through green code rain, a hologram and a scan "compiling" him from the feet up; his attack (Hack) is a
+*	green code beam that also scrambles its victim's screen a moment (LemHack message: byte duration in hundredths of a
+*	second, byte intensity); he dissolves into pixels when he dies, and de-rezzes when he goes back. He keeps the
+*	Pokemon's class name (monster_pokemon): every rule of theirs applies to him; his kills are credited to "lem".
+*	One companion at a time per player: one ball or laptop carried, or one ball in flight, Pokemon or Le M out.
+*/
+#pragma once
+
+enum PokemonSpecies
+{
+	PK_PIKACHU = 0,
+	PK_CHARIZARD,
