+// Half-Life arsenal (hl_weapons.h): the Half-Life SDK's weapons on Counter-Strike's weapon classes. Their fire events
+// reach the shooter too (no FEV_NOTHOST: the client does not predict them); their timers are the decremented ones of
+// Counter-Strike's weapons, their own delays in game time. Their entities are named with MAKE_STRING_CLASS: the game
+// finds entities by classname in a table of its own, which a bare pev->classname does not enter.
+#include "precompiled.h"
